                                                                        </div>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="modifier-popup-comment">
                                                                        <span>Based on AI emotion recognition, the subject exhibited a <span class="highlight">happy</span> emotional state, characterized by smiling facial expressions, raised cheeks, and bright eye contact</span>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
